  {
   "settings": {
    "analyzable": {
     "text": {
      "orig": "Linde",
      "transl": "Linde"
     }
    },
    "npcStates": [
     {
      "event": {
       "quest": [
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "name": {
          "orig": "Linde",
          "transl": "Linde"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "greenies-jungle.female-examiner-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Hi!",
          "transl": "Привіт!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "PROUD"
         }
        },
        null,
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Ahh, hello!\\. Are you the \\v[lore.title.seeker] that was sent to help me?",
          "transl": "Ahh, hallo!\\. Bist du der Seeker, der mir helfen soll?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "greenies-jungle.female-examiner-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "[nods]",
          "transl": "[киває]"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Oh, I'm so excited!\\. You \\v[lore.title.seeker]s are so cool and I have never worked with one.",
          "transl": "Oh, ich bin so aufgeregt!\\. Ihr Seeker seid so cool! Und ich habe noch nie mit einem gearbeitet!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "greenies-jungle.female-examiner-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Lea!",
          "transl": "Лія!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "EXCITED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Ah, I'm sorry!\\. I should concentrate on the work.\\. Important work with the help of a cool \\v[lore.title.seeker], yes, yes!",
          "transl": "Ah, tut mir leid!\\. Ich sollte mich auf meine Arbeit konzentrieren.\\. Wichtige Arbeit, verteidigt von coolem Seeker, ja, ja!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "greenies-jungle.female-examiner-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "I will use my tools here to examine the water at different spots in this area.",
          "transl": "Ich werde meine Geräte hier verwenden, um das Wasser an verschiedenen Stellen in der Umgebung zu untersuchen."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "greenies-jungle.female-examiner-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED_AWAY"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Gonna check for pollution and radiation and take those samples we need.",
          "transl": "Ich werde die Verschmutzung und Radioaktivität untersuchen und ein paar Proben nehmen."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "greenies-jungle.female-examiner-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Meanwhile, you will have to protect me from angry denizens of the Track that might appear.",
          "transl": "In der Zwischenzeit musst du mich vor angriffslustigen Pfadbewohnern beschützen.<<A<<[CHANGED 2021/05/22]"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "greenies-jungle.female-examiner-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SURPRISED_TOWARD"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Yes, it's such a shame that we have to hurt them, but we've got no choice here.",
          "transl": "Ja, es ist eine Schande, dass wir sie verletzen müssen, aber wir haben keine andere Wahl."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "greenies-jungle.female-examiner-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NERVOUS"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "At least their dead bodies will return to the Track and feed the new life, so it's okay!",
          "transl": "Wenigstens werden ihre toten Körper dem Pfad zurückgegeben und werden so wieder zu neuem Leben - also ist es okay!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "greenies-jungle.female-examiner-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "SMILE"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Anyway, I will prepare myself.\\. Talk to me again when you are ready to go!",
          "transl": "So, ich werde mich jetzt vorbereiten.\\. Sprich mich an, wenn du so weit bist!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "greenies-jungle.female-examiner-white",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "event": {
       "quest": [
